  "boxes": [
    {
      "title": "Pharmacies Management",
      "desc": "Pharmacist Login : Each pharmacist can log in through id and password or phone number and OTP. Authentication at each stage is a must for the overall security of the online medicine delivery app. Store details : The pharmacist will have all rights to add, delete and change the list of medication information available in the store. Easy to track available stock Order Notification : Each new order received will be notified to the pharmacists along with the prescription for verification purposes. Also, stores will be able to manage ongoing orders in real-time. Discounts and Payments : Pharmacists will have the rights to provide discounts and offer to a loyal customer; will all payments in the app and would be able to track payments in real-time. MIS management : The store can now easily keep a record of stock, check out for similar medicines, look after P&L of the store, record of the customer, etc with the online medicine delivery application."
    },
    {
      "title": "Courier Management",
      "desc": "Delivery boy login & details : All delivery partners can log in through id and password or phone number and OTP for authentication. Order Notification : When the order is placed delivery partner will receive a notification and details of pickup and delivery. Sharing Updates : Courier partners will have to share details of each process to help customers and pharmacists track the status in real-time. Delivery Status : The delivery partner will have to authenticate the customer with an OTP and then post handing over parcel need to update the same."
    },
    {
      "title": "Admin Management",
      "desc": "Manage user & supplier : The admin has the rights to add, edit and delete customers, suppliers, manufacturers, and delivery partners. Inventory Check : Admin will have all access to check stock at each store and notify about expiry date and low stock the suppliers. Design Campaigns : To attract more customers admin can design campaigns in various forms and try to sell more, helping pharmaceuticals to generate more profits. Analytics & Reports : Admin has access to monitor all the functions in the app and thus can bring together operational data and statistics, and help by providing interactive reports for smooth business flow helping boost the revenues."
    }
  ],
